{"4607750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hookah House", "steam_appid": 4607750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/hh-service?t=1788266855\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Hookah House</h2><br>Step into the world of hookah lounge management. Build your dream lounge from the ground up, serve customers, and grow your reputation as the go-to spot in town.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Service Loop</h2><br>Every customer that walks through your door needs your attention:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Greet and seat guests at available tables<br></li><li> Take their hookah orders and pick their preferred flavors<br></li><li> Pack bowls at the prep station and get the mix just right<br></li><li> Heat and deliver coals to keep hookahs going<br></li><li> Collect payments and earn tips for great service</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/4784eb59f447adb44d5e0ead0d3c5429.poster.avif?t=1788266855\" width=1170 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/4784eb59f447adb44d5e0ead0d3c5429.webm?t=1788266855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/4784eb59f447adb44d5e0ead0d3c5429.mp4?t=1788266855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build &amp; Customize Your Lounge</h2><br>Design a space that reflects your style. Place furniture, upgrade your equipment, swap out wall and floor finishes, and add decorations to create the perfect atmosphere. Every piece you place affects how your lounge looks and functions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/6875b683b1a9995abdeb2e171ec1a332.poster.avif?t=1788266855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/6875b683b1a9995abdeb2e171ec1a332.webm?t=1788266855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/6875b683b1a9995abdeb2e171ec1a332.mp4?t=1788266855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Business</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Stock a variety of premium tobacco flavors<br></li><li> Balance your budget between rent, supplies, and upgrades<br></li><li> Build a reputation that attracts more customers<br></li><li> Earn regular customers who keep coming back<br></li><li> Track your daily earnings and plan for growth</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/6652e2bd7b055d081051b06732142ff8.poster.avif?t=1788266855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/6652e2bd7b055d081051b06732142ff8.webm?t=1788266855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607750/extras/6652e2bd7b055d081051b06732142ff8.mp4?t=1788266855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hands-on service gameplay — seat, prep, deliver, collect<br></li><li> Full lounge customization with furniture, decor, and finishes<br></li><li> Tobacco flavor management and bowl packing<br></li><li> Reputation and customer loyalty systems<br></li><li> Relaxing, cozy atmosphere with day/night cycle<br></li><li> Currently in active development with regular updates<